# F swaps walking and the debug fly camera while the pointer is locked.

case starts in walk mode by default
expect mode = walk

case F toggles fly and back
click
lock
press KeyF
expect mode = fly
press KeyF
expect mode = walk

case F does nothing while unlocked, or on auto-repeat
press KeyF
expect mode = walk
click
lock
down KeyF
repeat KeyF
repeat KeyF
up KeyF
expect mode = fly

case switching to fly keeps the eye where it was
start walk raft
click
lock
frame 50 x4
mark
press KeyF
frame 1
expect moved < 0.5

case walking in the raft scene moves the player
start walk raft
click
lock
frame 50 x10
mark
down KeyW
frame 50 x10
expect moved > 0.3

case fly and back while sneaking keeps the eye where it was
start walk raft
click
lock
down ShiftLeft
frame 50 x20
frame 1
mark
press KeyF
press KeyF
frame 1
expect moved < 0.02
